2026-07-26T10:38:45.6600059Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:38:45.6601142Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:38:45.6601888Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
